<HTML>
<BODY BGCOLOR="#000000" TEXT="#FFFFFF" LINK="#90FFFF" VLINK="#CCCCCC">
<FONT FACE="Arial,Helvetica">

<SCRIPT LANGUAGE="JavaScript">

<!--//

   if (document.images) {

      // Load images needed [BACK] button.

      back_on  = new Image(); back_on.src  = "../../buttons/back_on.gif";  
      back_off = new Image(); back_off.src = "../../buttons/back.gif";  
   }

   function TurnOn() {

      // Displays image and updates status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_on.src;
         window.status = 'Go back to previous page';
      }
   }

   function TurnOff() {

      // Displays image and clears status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_off.src;
         window.status = '';
      }
   }

//-->

</SCRIPT>

<H3><CENTER><FONT COLOR="#ffff00"><A HREF="mailto:antz.dam@orange.net">Antonio Damiano</A></FONT></CENTER></H3>

	Antz has had two Tipo 16Vs. His first he wrote off in an accident. The second
	one he bought in August 2000. After taking it to a FIAT dealer for a full
	service it came back with no oil and subsequently seized up. Antz found
	a donor engine and is back on the road again.

